"Superhumans at Large, or SAL, is an outlaw group helping Avowed escape Anesidora."
"Its members speak of 'the fight' and of Anesidora as a palace that is also a prison."
"It smuggles escapees by boat, stocked with stolen potions, spell ingredients and weapons."
"It is an often-violent movement, and the official story of the Matadero attack links it to SAL."
"Some other free-Avowed groups clash with SAL but unite with it for big jobs."
